msgid ""
"Automatic keymap rules apply only when the keymap is chosen automatically "
"(Keymaps page)."
msgstr "仅当 Keymap 为自动选择时（Keymap 页面），自动 Keymap 规则才生效。"

msgid ""
"Borderless windows covering the screen count too. Browsers, video players "
"and presentations are ignored."
msgstr "覆盖整个屏幕的无边框窗口也算在内。浏览器、视频播放器和演示文稿会被忽略。"

msgid "Game mode is off (set manually)"
msgstr "游戏模式已关闭（手动设置）"

msgid "Game mode is on (set manually)"
msgstr "游戏模式已开启（手动设置）"

msgid "Game mode turns on rules and automatic keymap rules that have a game-mode condition. Automatic keymap rules apply only when the keymap is chosen automatically (Keymaps page). Auto uses the detection sources and custom rules below; On and Off set the state manually. “Doesn't count as a game” takes priority over automatic detection and “Counts as a game”. You can also change the mode in the top bar, in the tray menu or with a key bound to a game mode action."
msgstr "游戏模式会启用带有游戏模式条件的规则和自动 Keymap 规则。仅当 Keymap 为自动选择时（Keymap 页面），自动 Keymap 规则才生效。“自动”使用下方的检测来源和自定义规则；“开”和“关”手动设置状态。“不算游戏”优先于自动检测和“算作游戏”。您也可以在顶部栏、托盘菜单中或通过绑定了游戏模式操作的按键更改模式。"



msgid "Game mode: always off"
msgstr "游戏模式：始终关闭"

msgid "Game mode: always on"
msgstr "游戏模式：始终开启"

msgid "Game mode: detect automatically"
msgstr "游戏模式：自动检测"

msgid "Toggle game mode"
msgstr "切换游戏模式"

msgid ""
"GameMode daemon unavailable: check the gamemode package and session D-Bus."
msgstr "GameMode 守护进程不可用：请检查 gamemode 软件包和会话 D-Bus。"

msgid ""
"Install {} to detect the active window and fullscreen windows. It is also "
"needed for application conditions in rules."
msgstr "安装 {} 以检测活动窗口和全屏窗口。规则中的应用条件也需要它。"

msgid ""
"Nothing uses game mode yet: no rule or automatic keymap rule has a game-mode"
" condition, so turning it on changes nothing."
msgstr "目前还没有任何地方使用游戏模式：没有规则或自动 Keymap 规则带有游戏模式条件，因此开启它不会有任何变化。"

msgid ""
"On and Off are remembered after restart. Auto keeps detecting in the "
"background."
msgstr "“开”和“关”在重启后会保留。“自动”在后台持续检测。"

msgid ""
"Rules of the current keymap with a game-mode condition: {}. Automatic keymap"
" rules with a game-mode condition: {}."
msgstr "当前 Keymap 中带游戏模式条件的规则：{}。带游戏模式条件的自动 Keymap 规则：{}。"

msgid ""
"Turns on while a game runs through gamemoderun or requests GameMode itself. "
"In Steam set the launch options to “gamemoderun %command%”."
msgstr "当游戏通过 gamemoderun 运行或自行请求 GameMode 时开启。在 Steam 中将启动选项设为“gamemoderun %command%”。"

msgid "Game mode: on"
